inscriptions.inscription:
1 colophon and 2 seals of Shao Changheng 邵長蘅 (1637–1704); 
2 inscriptions and 14 seals of the Qianlong 乾隆 emperor (r. 1736–95); 
1 seal of the Jiaqing 嘉慶 emperor (r. 1796–1820); 
3 seals of the Xuantong 宣統 emperor (r. 1908–11); 
1 seal unidentified.

7 seals of Qianlong emperor  (r. 1736–95): 

Gu xi tian zi 古希天子; 
Shou 壽; 
Qianlong jian shang 乾隆鑑賞; 
San xi tang jing jian xi 三希堂精鑑璽; 
Yi zi sun 宜子孫; 
Tai shang huang di zhi bao 太上皇帝之寳; 
Qian qing gong bao 乾清宮寶.

6 seals of Cheng Qi 程琦 (1911–1988): 

Ke an geng zi wu shi yi hou suo de ming ji 可菴庚子五十以後所得名跡; 
5 other Cheng Qi seals.

8 imperial seals: 
6 of the Qianlong emperor (r. 1736–95); 
1 of the Jiaqing emperor (r. 1796–1821); 
1 of the Xuantong emperor (r. 1909–11).

Section A (Chrysanthemums): 
1 poem and 1 seal of Zhang Yuanzhen 張元禎 (1437–1507) - Jinshi, 1461; 
1 poems and 3 seals of Ni Yue 倪岳 (1444–1501) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poems and 2 seals of Zhao Xiang 趙祥 (life dates unknown) - Jinshi, 1469; 
1 poems and 1 seals of Wu Xixian 吳希賢 (1437–1489) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poems and 1 seals of Lü Chang 呂㦂 (1449–1511) - Juren, 1471; 
1 poems and 3 seals of Fu Han 傅瀚 (1435–1502) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poems and 1 seals of Feng Jue 馮珏 (life dates unknown) - Jinshi, 1478.

Section B (Cabbage): 
1 poem and 1 seal of Cai Qi 蔡圻 (life dates unknown) - degree information not known; 
1 poems and 3 seals of Ni Yue 倪岳 (1444–1501) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poem and 3 seals of Jiao Fang 焦芳 (1436–1517) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poem and 3 seals of Li Dongyang 李東陽 (1447–1516) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poems and 1 seals of Wu Xixian, signed “Xixian” 吳希賢 - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poems and 3 seals of Fu Han 傅瀚 (1435–1502) - Jinshi, 1464; 
1 poems and 1 seals of Lü Chang 呂㦂 (1449–1511) - Juren, 1471; 
1 poems and 2 seals of Zhao Xiang 趙祥 (life dates unknown) - Jinshi, 1469; 
1 poems and 1 seals of Feng Jue 馮珏 (life dates unknown) - Jinshi, 1478.

9 additional seals:  
5 of the Qianlong emperor (r. 1736–95); 
3 of the Jiaqing emperor (r. 1796–1820); 
1 of the Xuantong emperor (r. 1909–11).
